      "The tightening program must come from get-program and may not appear as literal values.",
      "transport-tool must be executed by agvexecutor."
    ],
    "preference": "Fastest possible execution, because line 3 is in a hurry.",
    "priority": "high",
    "horizon": "Immediate, for a single execution",
    "requested_capabilities": [],
    "omit_services": ["evaluate-tightening", "record-tightening"]
  },
